<title>USA: Jacor in $50 mln purchase of E.F.M. Media.</title>
<headline>Jacor in $50 mln purchase of E.F.M. Media.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, Ky. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacor Communications Inc said Friday that it has closed its acquisition of E.F.M. Media Management for $50 million in cash.</p>
<p>E.F.M. owns and distributes syndicated talk radio prgramming, including shows by Rush Limbaugh and Dr. Jean Edell, said the company.</p>
<p>Jacor owns, operates, represents or provides programming for 130 radio stations in 27 broacdast markets.</p>
